==English==
[[File:New haven directory 1878.jpg|thumb|New Haven (Connecticut) telephone directory 1878]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|telephone directories}}

# A [[listing]] of telephone [[subscriber]]s in a specific [[geographical]] [[area]], together with their [[telephone number]]s and, sometimes, a [[street]] [[address]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|directory}}
* {{l|en|phonebook}}
* {{l|en|telephone book}}

